g11-audio-12-1
00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:07.400
Unit 12, Natural Disasters.

g11-audio-12-2
00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:12.780
Today, I'm going to interview three people who witnessed natural disasters.

g11-audio-12-3
00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:18.500
The first is Wunmar, whose native town is Bogalay, Ayeyarwady region.

g11-audio-12-4
00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:25.080
Wunmar, tell us about the worst natural disaster you have experienced throughout your life.

g11-audio-12-5
00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:31.060
Well, I'm now 22. And it happened 13 years ago.

g11-audio-12-6
00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:35.920
On the 2nd of May while I was living in a small village in Bogalay Township,

g11-audio-12-7
00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.360
Ayeyarwady Delta.

g11-audio-12-8
00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:44.940
Cyclone Nargis hit our area which is vulnerable to cyclones, as it is low lying and open to the sea.

g11-audio-12-9
00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:50.300
As it was a storm surge, the winds pushed a wall of water inland.

g11-audio-12-10
00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:54.480
So, the water got higher than buildings and trees.

g11-audio-12-11
00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:58.420
When the storm was over, I looked around my village.

g11-audio-12-12
00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.100
One word can describe the situation heartbreaking.

g11-audio-12-13
00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:04.480
We lost almost everything.

g11-audio-12-14
00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.800
Our relatives, our homes and our businesses.

g11-audio-12-15
00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:11.380
Oh, I really don't know what to say.

g11-audio-12-16
00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:12.920
I'm very sorry.

g11-audio-12-17
00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:17.980
Right now, I'd like to ask Utint Nguyen, about his experience.

g11-audio-12-18
00:01:18.800 --> 00:01:22.400
Can you tell us about the moment you have been affected by a natural disaster?

g11-audio-12-19
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.960
What was the experience like?

g11-audio-12-20
00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:29.860
Last year, I returned to my home country from India.

g11-audio-12-21
00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:35.540
I was sent to a quarantine center as it was the time of COVID-19 pandemic.

g11-audio-12-22
00:01:36.180 --> 00:01:42.420
After 4 or 5 days of my arrival, I got a fever and couldn't sense any taste and smell.

g11-audio-12-23
00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:48.260
So, I had to undergo the swab test and the experience was very uncomfortable.

g11-audio-12-24
00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:53.740
Sadly, I tested positive and so, I was sent to the hospital.

g11-audio-12-25
00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:55.620
I was lucky enough.

g11-audio-12-26
00:01:56.460 --> 00:02:01.040
Unlike other serious cases, I didn't have much difficulty in breathing.

g11-audio-12-27
00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:08.100
I was discharged from the hospital, after I tested negative of coronavirus for 2 times.

g11-audio-12-28
00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:11.580
That one month was quite a hard time for me.

g11-audio-12-29
00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:14.440
I'm so sorry to hear that.

g11-audio-12-30
00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:16.420
Now, Da Kin Ma.

g11-audio-12-31
00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:21.260
Can you tell us about the natural disaster you have witnessed in your life?

g11-audio-12-32
00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:22.800
What was it like?

g11-audio-12-33
00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:31.280
One fine afternoon in August, 2016, my family and I were going around the temples in Bagan.

g11-audio-12-34
00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:35.900
Suddenly, I felt movements on the ground and felt dizzy.

g11-audio-12-35
00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:41.940
As soon as we realized that it was an earthquake, we ran out from the temple quickly.

g11-audio-12-36
00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:49.180
Luckily, no one in Bagan was injured but nearly 400 pagodas were damaged.

g11-audio-12-37
00:02:50.060 --> 00:03:00.980
Struck by a 6.8 magnitude earthquake, the place looked shredded, with collapsed walls, piles of rubble and brick debris littering the archaeological zone.

g11-audio-12-38
00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:02.980
That's a shame.

g11-audio-12-39
00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:05.840
Well, this is the end of our interview.

g11-audio-12-40
00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.940
Thanks for sharing your experiences with us.

g11-audio-12-41
00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.620
Thank you, all the listeners, for being with us.
